# S8 deletions.
#
# These rules name a class that the NEXT commit deletes. A "D" entry is not a
# file being sent, it is the instruction to remove one already in the org, so
# .forceignore must not suppress it - otherwise the file is stranded in the org
# for good. Expect the delete to go through despite these rules.
classes/ToDelete.cls
classes/ToDelete.cls-meta.xml
